{'symbol': 'ROK', 'date': '2021-11-23 20:46:00', 'title': 'PTC AND ROCKWELL AUTOMATION ISSUE STATEMENT IN RESPONSE TO BERENBERG CAPITAL MARKETS RESEARCH REPORT', 'text': 'BOSTON, NOV. 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PTC (NASDAQ: PTC) AND ROCKWELL AUTOMATION (NYSE: ROK) TODAY ISSUED A JOINT STATEMENT IN RESPONSE TO A RESEARCH REPORT PUBLISHED BY BERENBERG CAPITAL MARKETS THIS MORNING INCORRECTLY STATING THAT ROCKWELL IS "CUTTING FINANCIAL TIES WITH PTC" AND THAT "IT WAS ANNOUNCED YESTERDAY THAT ROCKWELL WILL BE SELLING ITS ENTIRE STAKE, AN 8.98% OWNERSHIP, IN PTC."\xa0 BOTH STATEMENTS ARE INCORRECT AND BERENBERG HAS SINCE ISSUED A RETRACTION.'}